---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Receive">
  <h1>Receive offline</h1>
  <p>
    The Go recipient tool is in development; no signed downloadable receiver is
    available yet.
  </p>
  <p>
    The released receiver will read raw ciphertext and a local encrypted private
    PEM, prompt without echo, authenticate the message and save exact plaintext
    to a new private file. It will never ask you to upload private material to
    this website.
  </p>
</Layout>
